# url-edit (h2-input): the hash edited while the page runs.
# After opening at rest, the hash becomes center=7,-8&scale=4: on ref/web the
# page's own hashchange path runs, natively the harness syncs and frames; the
# params sync and the still camera adopts, so the camera follows (behaviour:
# views camera line center [7,-8] scale 4, url line center=7,-8&scale=4).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
hash center=7,-8&scale=4
wait 800
shot url-edit
